msgid "Camera Shutter Triggering using CHDK"
msgstr "使用 CHDK 触发相机快门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:9
#: 023678e22baf4663873879f18dd86b49 1d8c87b8d5d44f9e9008313b86c8af39
#: 387768f02b1e4bd8a434f3c6e42fd938 d73ed070c2a84c17857a8624fc2826e9
#: f405f1a7e2f949a78cd254241c26a045
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up camera shutter triggering for Canon "
"Cameras that support the `Canon Hacker Development Kit "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ (CHDK)."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何为支持 `Canon Hacker Development Kit <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__"
" （CHDK）的佳能相机设置相机快门触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:13
#: 283e144970c348be827d61c4582ef7f9 b4a6a87a7d054746af36fea65dca1b54
#: bb96925667d14902bb144b7a0516c407 e17ec54408414a9dbb0a0f781d03fc82
#: fb7f90b7fd4048bfbb5b4a5c41592b86
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:15
#: 09b1023c118d4f82ab2ade5616207bf5 2982c864639a489095d694fa27a7c7d5
#: 5f9d2d3c2cb44e6caa69aaa5b1eabd09 806210336b244b4eafab7eb4ccaf435a
#: 9103247a0a4941f6a1a2c1ab281f34fd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows you to :ref:`configure a servo or relay output as the "
"control signal for the camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` so"
" that it can be used in :ref:`Camera Missions <common-camera-control-and-"
"auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. Additional hardware is required to "
"convert the shutter activation signal to the format expected by the "
"particular camera."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 允许您 :ref:`将舵机或继电器输出配置为相机快门的控制信号 <common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>`，以便在 :ref:`拍照任务 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>` 中使用。需要额外硬件将快门触发信号转换为特定相机所需的格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:22
#: 1daf9d4457eb4255b2db76477c87f50c 4104d928f3414b3a9d735995758d00c1
#: 89e1d3e3ce954c54bdec507276a2e92b eb4faaf65dec4743ab222b806637340f
#: ff9e41e3b7b54ffb8b7282162afdc885
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up the shutter-trigger for Canon Cameras "
"that support the *Canon Hacker Development Kit* (CHDK). The method connects "
"the ArduPilot output to the camera using a \\*custom cable\\*, and causes a "
"script running on the camera to take pictures when the *relay* output "
"voltage goes high."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何为支持 *Canon Hacker Development Kit* （CHDK）的佳能相机设置快门触发。该方法通过 \\ *定制线缆\\*"
" 将 ArduPilot 输出连接到相机，当 *继电器* 输出电压变高时，运行在相机上的脚本触发拍照。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:28
#: 10c65ef234554bf9824f80e819c824b8 428d96f029d24f148dac6ff7f34a2254
#: 75aee5c4a99b47399c9b1a2092aff3a7 a9ca3c5911cf41f4ab2cec97291d3dc3
#: ec4dedb9924a4acba85e83cca1ae62a5
msgid ""
"At the end of the article is a :ref:`list of cables that you can purchase "
"<common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>` instead "
"of using the custom cable (please extend this list if you find another "
"appropriate cable)."
msgstr ""
"本文末尾提供了 :ref:`可购买的现成线缆列表 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>`，代替自制线缆（如果您发现其他合适的线缆，请扩充此列表）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:32
#: 2ea73b6d8a6d4800a38df2a09248b5af 31f8102a85a9428c9c187b985d21c129
#: 37cf00c870aa4356a531245f0de56c8b 5a08e1960ddc4aa3bc2426d6d5c13cff
#: 660992e533fc48f095dade728af41693
msgid "The article covers both Pixhawk and APM2.x."
msgstr "本文同时适用于 Pixhawk 和 APM2.x。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:39
#: 22784db8efc1456d9b6371dff5dccce8 39fb6e77f3b24f968236fa6c48dd5562
#: 4eb4340f514848018c7d7057d2b5a371 64e39907ee054a5580aa78aa1e4921df
#: f5a7e6baf657429abf13f29276928731
msgid "APM Connected to a Canon SX260 HS using a custom cable"
msgstr "APM 通过定制线缆连接到 Canon SX260 HS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:43
#: 22bf526dc48e4fec9ce2959abfef7aec 7cad74b9bb8d4abb959038d6638ab183
#: 89838a8ce0e24bb0be7b310bf9fe5261 98f70ca7bb1c45a1bced768494f18e52
#: d03844a172c642c6b17f0c87b55bc40b
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use a :ref:`servo output instead of a relay <common-"
"apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial_using_a_servo_instead_of_a_relay>`."
msgstr ""
"也可以 :ref:`使用舵机输出代替继电器 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_using_a_servo_instead_of_a_relay>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:47
#: 13d6158dd463480f97498f7b0320cd6a 395135982bc04c1987c5e96deb770743
#: 6fdd233891ed4f54af4030345c68249d b3a10bc029b840eeb7a447773dd853d3
#: c02fa846fdfd4bf288e7c37617e9e7e0
msgid "CHKD and ArduPilot integration"
msgstr "CHKD 与 ArduPilot 集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:49
#: 273292bca22a425f98efbc35e0aeb932 308c430e5c9d4729a388a572213f1ab7
#: 6cd85d0e150b4024a9ffa25de59825d7 bad06e95e1d4485aa43f20f962d37843
#: cc0e4edb2822485abbd196eb562894a4
msgid ""
"CHDK is an experimental (and free) development tool, which temporarily "
"patches (supported) *Canon cameras* so that they can be controlled using "
"scripts. The scripts are able to take pictures, control the camera zoom, set"
" the focus, and access many other camera features."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 是一个实验性（且免费）的开发工具，可临时对（受支持的） *佳能相机* "
"进行修补，使其可以通过脚本控制。这些脚本能够拍照、控制相机变焦、设置对焦以及访问许多其他相机功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:54
#: 5d7477b460b247b7a3dd5ee499ee3464
msgid ""
"Scripts can also read the camera USB port voltage and execute different "
"instructions/functions based on the signal pulse-length. When using a relay,"
" the script can be very simple — all it needs to do is check the voltage (in"
" a loop), and take a picture when it detects the relay voltage go high. More"
" complicated scripts might first set the focus, zoom, or preform any other "
"default behaviour."
msgstr ""
"脚本还可以读取相机 USB "
"端口电压，并根据信号脉冲宽度执行不同的指令/函数。使用继电器时，脚本可以非常简单——只需在循环中检测电压，当检测到继电器电压升高时拍照即可。更复杂的脚本可能先设置对焦、变焦或执行其他默认操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:61
#: 7646df670a334974b16b42ada36e54f2 7abcb7ae4b8f4561a395da32b751d963
#: a08dedc6b9884db9ab5d80db52b796f6 b974a62be5f94543a60bfefa744132eb
#: fc3a0b3437da45789f34047d06f39601
msgid ""
"The `CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ documentation explains "
"which cameras are supported, how you install CHDK on you camera, and how to "
"install and run scripts."
msgstr ""
"`CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ 文档介绍了哪些相机受支持、如何在您的相机上安装 "
"CHDK，以及如何安装和运行脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:66
#: 0a91bafda32043a9ab8f998bb8594e38 0b0f073c8c41442e824927b86d591e70
#: 66d59981dbd147939e923283c6ff8902 69417de3d8ef4dc18e843b0218c6069d
#: b4d96af80b87495a8a28ef32499c073f
