#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:70
#: 8c03031608e740639fc82e6a2ee6f3a2 ad1f9a29639f41dc9e2d43e601827108
#: b272e8637a4840faac18668514923f84 b690591fae6448cd8a97170c0b00df14
#: f8154cef864b4b02b9c4d8e99e824bec
msgid ""
"See :ref:`CHDK cables for purchase <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>` if you just want to buy a cable. This "
"section is useful if you want to create your own cable or understand what "
"the cable needs to do."
msgstr ""
"如果只想购买现成线缆，请参见 :ref:`可购买的 CHDK 线缆 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>`。如果想自制线缆或了解线缆的功能，本节内容有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:74
#: 31036055e48c4f7ea4e173c3cf64ba56 3543c8e05eb64c06a66eb617f081d2aa
#: 511f1cbaee99485fb85a3c98046f95f2 b8b93e454296460980e07194f640c7c6
#: c4b31dbe37624736bf07e46d5110218d
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk you have to modify the APM cable in the following section, "
"adding a circuit step the output pin signal voltage from 3.3 to 5 volts. "
"This is required because the relay/servo output voltage is approximately "
"3.3V while CHDK needs 5V to trigger."
msgstr ""
"对于 Pixhawk，您必须修改以下部分的 APM 线缆，添加一个将输出引脚信号电压从 3.3V 升到 5V "
"的电路。这是必要的，因为继电器/舵机输出电压约为 3.3V，而 CHDK 需要 5V 触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:79
#: 68ea0e85adc6452dac73c38dae82ef15 81f54e12d41e422199c916a7a3ac4cf6
#: e0dd55970355489a9d7fdd908cd6ff2f f84a883c586b49d18c3d457da55696d7
#: ff10bd5a33424fb3b3223e76f95d5046
msgid ""
"A circuit and PCB you can use are shown below. 5V should be supplied from a "
"BEC (or from a BEC powering the central pin on the AUX output rail) because "
"the servo rail itself is not powered."
msgstr "下方显示了可以使用的电路和 PCB。5V 应由 BEC 提供（或从 AUX 输出轨中间引脚上的 BEC 供电），因为舵机轨本身没有供电。"

